It's a write-off.
那算作坏账核销了。

1250
00:56:32.590 --> 00:56:33.710
I'll give it to you.
我把它给你吧。

1251
00:56:36.730 --> 00:56:37.210
Okay.
好吧。

1252
00:56:37.350 --> 00:56:37.830
Amazing.
太棒了。

1253
00:56:38.150 --> 00:56:38.490
Amazing.
太棒了。

1254
00:56:38.790 --> 00:56:44.150
So Michael is spiraling out, though, because he's realizing Blue Cross from Pennsylvania
迈克尔现在快崩溃了，因为他意识到宾夕法尼亚州的蓝十字保险公司

1255
00:56:44.150 --> 00:56:45.670
getting this many golden tickets.
拿到了这么多金奖券。

1256
00:56:46.010 --> 00:56:47.290
He's going to get fired.
他要被解雇了。

1257
00:56:47.290 --> 00:56:50.850
And Jim is upset, too, because that's his commission.
吉姆也很心烦，因为那是他的佣金。

1258
00:56:51.130 --> 00:56:51.690
Oh, right.
哦，对。

1259
00:56:51.890 --> 00:56:52.130
Right?
是吧？

1260
00:56:52.390 --> 00:56:55.350
So Michael is going to storm down to the warehouse.
所以迈克尔打算冲到仓库去。

1261
00:56:55.490 --> 00:56:57.230
I love the beginning of this scene.
我喜欢这一幕的开头。

1262
00:56:57.310 --> 00:56:58.550
This scene is brilliant.
这一幕太精彩了。

1263
00:56:58.550 --> 00:57:03.510
He goes barreling in going, hey, hey, hey, you idiot, to Daryl.
他横冲直撞地走进去，对达里尔喊道：嘿，嘿，嘿，你这个白痴。

1264
00:57:03.670 --> 00:57:05.950
And Daryl says, start over.
然后达里尔说：重来。

1265
00:57:06.430 --> 00:57:07.250
So good.
太棒了。

1266
00:57:07.290 --> 00:57:08.930
I was like, I'm keeping that.
我当时就想，我要把这句记下来。

1267
00:57:09.050 --> 00:57:10.010
I am keeping that.
我一定要记下来。

1268
00:57:10.110 --> 00:57:13.430
The next time one of the kids has a moment where they're sassing me, I'm going to be like,
下次要是孩子们再敢跟我顶嘴，我就要对他们说：

1269
00:57:13.950 --> 00:57:14.630
start over.
重来。

1270
00:57:15.170 --> 00:57:15.650
Exactly.
没错。

1271
00:57:15.650 --> 00:57:18.010
And then Michael comes back with, sir?
然后迈克尔回了一句：先生？

1272
00:57:19.810 --> 00:57:21.210
That was all in the script.
那全是剧本里写的。

1273
00:57:21.210 --> 00:57:22.210
I looked that up.
我特意查过了。

1274
00:57:22.210 --> 00:57:22.970
I had to know.
我必须得知道。

1275
00:57:22.970 --> 00:57:23.610
So did I.
我也是。

1276
00:57:24.190 --> 00:57:26.130
Michael's like, Daryl, how could this happen?
迈克尔问：达里尔，这怎么可能发生？

1277
00:57:26.290 --> 00:57:27.130
How could this happen?
这怎么可能发生？

1278
00:57:27.290 --> 00:57:31.290
And he says, I put three pallets on the truck for Blue Cross every week.
他说：我每周都往发往蓝十字的卡车上装三个托盘。

1279
00:57:32.010 --> 00:57:33.330
Where were you putting the boxes?
你把箱子放在哪儿了？

1280
00:57:33.370 --> 00:57:34.310
Were they near each other?
它们挨在一起吗？

1281
00:57:34.610 --> 00:57:37.390
And Michael's like, I need to ask you something.
然后迈克尔说：我得问你件事。

1282
00:57:37.470 --> 00:57:38.590
I need you to be honest with me.
我需要你对我诚实。

1283
00:57:39.470 --> 00:57:40.550
What is a pallet?
什么是托盘？

1284
00:57:40.550 --> 00:57:43.240
So good.
太搞笑了。

1285
00:57:44.280 --> 00:57:45.200
So good.
太搞笑了。

1286
00:57:45.980 --> 00:57:47.540
David Wallace is not happy.
大卫·华莱士很不高兴。

1287
00:57:48.160 --> 00:57:49.120
He calls.
他打来了电话。

1288
00:57:49.400 --> 00:57:50.620
Pam takes the call.
帕姆接了电话。

1289
00:57:50.980 --> 00:57:53.640
But Michael is sort of sneaking out of his office.
但迈克尔正鬼鬼祟祟地溜出办公室。

1290
00:57:53.780 --> 00:57:55.620
He's taken off his Willy Wonka outfit.
他已经脱掉了威利·旺卡的服装。

1291
00:57:55.920 --> 00:57:57.420
Yeah, he's getting rid of the evidence.
对，他在销毁证据。

1292
00:57:57.640 --> 00:57:57.920
Yes.
没错。

1293
00:57:58.060 --> 00:57:59.480
He's like, I am not here.
他表现得好像他不在那儿。

1294
00:57:59.580 --> 00:58:00.240
I am not here.
我不在那儿。

1295
00:58:00.420 --> 00:58:04.740
So Pam has to say that he's at a civil rights rally at the Lincoln Memorial.
所以帕姆不得不说他在林肯纪念堂参加民权集会。

1296
00:58:05.020 --> 00:58:07.200
Which I want to point out is in Washington.
我得指出，那是在华盛顿。

1297
00:58:07.200 --> 00:58:11.000
Yeah, he's gone to Washington, D.C., I guess.
是啊，我猜他是去华盛顿特区了。

1298
00:58:11.040 --> 00:58:15.300
In the same day, he's going to go to a civil rights movement in Washington, D.C.
在同一天里，他既要去华盛顿特区参加民权运动，

1299
00:58:15.440 --> 00:58:15.900
and get
又要

1300
00:58:15.900 --> 00:58:17.240
a colonoscopy in Scranton.
在斯克兰顿做肠镜检查。

1301
00:58:18.020 --> 00:58:18.540
Exactly.
没错。

1302
00:58:20.240 --> 00:58:24.140
Well, Michael tosses his Willy Wonka costume into a dumpster.
迈克尔把他的威利·旺卡戏服扔进了垃圾桶。

1303
00:58:24.360 --> 00:58:27.440
He's now wearing a Pioneers football shirt.
他现在穿着一件先锋队的橄榄球衫。

1304
00:58:28.140 --> 00:58:30.260
And I had to look this up.
我特意去查了一下。

1305
00:58:30.260 --> 00:58:36.460
This is a minor league football team from Wilkes-Barre Scranton that played in the AF2.
这是威尔克斯-巴里/斯克兰顿的一支小联盟橄榄球队，曾参加过AF2联赛。

1306
00:58:36.680 --> 00:58:42.100
And they had a really strong season in 2009 when we shot this episode.
我们在拍摄这一集时的2009年，他们打出了非常强势的一个赛季。

1307
00:58:42.460 --> 00:58:47.560
It's kind of like perfect that he's wearing this shirt because they only ended up losing
他穿这件衣服简直太合适了，因为他们那一年最终只输了

1308
00:58:47.560 --> 00:58:49.280
two of their games that year.
两场比赛。

1309
00:58:49.440 --> 00:58:50.860
They made it to the playoffs.
他们打进了季后赛。

1310
00:58:50.860 --> 00:58:56.780
Then they made it all the way to the Arena Cup, which is like the Super Bowl of AF2 football.
然后一路杀进了竞技场杯，那相当于AF2橄榄球界的超级碗。

1311
00:58:56.780 --> 00:59:01.460
They ended up losing, but it was like a great, great season for them.
他们最后输了，但对他们来说那是一个非常、非常棒的赛季。

1312
00:59:01.560 --> 00:59:02.500
They were kind of on a roll.
他们当时势头正猛。

1313
00:59:02.640 --> 00:59:04.400
Their previous season had been good as well.
他们之前的赛季表现也不错。

1314
00:59:04.640 --> 00:59:05.620
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

1315
00:59:05.780 --> 00:59:07.780
I love every time we have-
我喜欢我们每次有——

1316
00:59:07.780 --> 00:59:08.660
Every single time.
每一次。

1317
00:59:08.720 --> 00:59:13.380
These local references on the show in ways that don't even get mentioned.
剧里这些甚至都不会被提及的本地彩蛋。

1318
00:59:13.640 --> 00:59:13.840
Right.
对。

1319
00:59:14.040 --> 00:59:19.820
We never even mention this shirt, but there it is, just creating specificity.
我们甚至从没提过这件衬衫，但它就在那儿，增加了真实感。

1320
00:59:19.980 --> 00:59:20.580
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

1321
00:59:21.060 --> 00:59:23.740
Michael's going to make an announcement, everyone to the conference room.
迈克尔要宣布事情了，大家去会议室。

1322
00:59:23.900 --> 00:59:25.620
He's a lot of announcements in this episode.
他在这一集里宣布了很多事情。

1323
00:59:25.700 --> 00:59:26.460
A lot of announcements.
很多宣布。

1324
00:59:27.120 --> 00:59:31.120
He's really, I think, just trying to find a way out.
我觉得他真的只是在想办法脱身。

1325
00:59:31.340 --> 00:59:36.660
He says he has a big net where he takes all of their subconscious ideas and tries to turn
他说他有一个大网，能捕捉到大家所有的潜意识想法，并试图把它们

1326
00:59:36.660 --> 00:59:37.420
them into something.
变成现实。

1327
00:59:37.880 --> 00:59:40.660
And Michael's like, guys, guys, they're not going to fire us.
迈克尔说，伙计们，伙计们，他们不会解雇我们的。

1328
00:59:40.820 --> 00:59:41.260
We're fine.
我们没事的。

1329
00:59:41.420 --> 00:59:44.300
And Oscar's like, what do you call shutting down a branch?
奥斯卡说，那你管关闭分公司叫什么？

1330
00:59:44.840 --> 00:59:50.180
And then Michael says, someone needs to come up with a golden ticket idea to get them out
然后迈克尔说，需要有人想出一个“金奖券”点子来帮他们摆脱

1331
00:59:50.180 --> 00:59:50.780
of this mess.
目前的困境。

1332
00:59:51.340 --> 00:59:51.680
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1333
00:59:52.080 --> 00:59:52.560
You know?
你懂吗？

1334
00:59:53.080 --> 00:59:56.860
And Pam says, do you mean an idea that blows up in our faces later?
帕姆说，你是说那种后来会让我们自食其果的点子吗？

1335
00:59:57.180 --> 00:59:57.580
Oh.
噢。

1336
00:59:57.700 --> 00:59:58.480
That kind of idea?
那种点子？

1337
00:59:58.500 --> 00:59:59.560
That's some Pam sass.
帕姆真刻薄。

1338
00:59:59.720 --> 01:00:01.020
That is some Pam sass.
帕姆真是太刻薄了。

1339
01:00:01.760 --> 01:00:05.120
So while Michael's up at the top of the conference room, he's wearing a suit jacket.
所以当迈克尔站在会议室前面时，他穿着一件西装外套。

1340
01:00:05.340 --> 01:00:05.620
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1341
01:00:05.620 --> 01:00:07.120
And I'm thinking, where did that come from?
我在想，那件外套是从哪儿来的？

1342
01:00:07.120 --> 01:00:10.880
Because the last time we saw him, he was at the dumpster in his Pioneer's football shirt.
因为我们上次见到他时，他还在垃圾桶旁穿着先锋队的橄榄球衫。

1343
01:00:11.060 --> 01:00:11.260
Right.
对。

1344
01:00:11.640 --> 01:00:12.540
I looked it up.
我查了一下。

1345
01:00:13.360 --> 01:00:14.580
It's Andy's jacket.
那是安迪的外套。

1346
01:00:14.860 --> 01:00:16.220
He's wearing Andy's jacket.
他穿着安迪的外套。

1347
01:00:16.220 --> 01:00:21.040
And there was a bit at the top of this scene that got cut where, as they're entering the
这一幕开头有一段被剪掉的戏，当他们走进

1348
01:00:21.040 --> 01:00:23.160
room, Michael says, Andy, give me your jacket.
房间时，迈克尔说，安迪，把你的外套给我。

1349
01:00:23.340 --> 01:00:24.500
You can do something for me.
你可以帮我个忙。

1350
01:00:24.780 --> 01:00:25.840
I want your jacket.
我想要你的外套。

1351
01:00:26.040 --> 01:00:30.680
So that is why he's now wearing this odd jacket over his football shirt.
所以这就是他现在在足球衫外面套着这件奇怪夹克的原因。

1352
01:00:30.720 --> 01:00:32.480
Well, he's got to still look like the boss.
嗯，他还是得保持老板的派头。

1353
01:00:32.920 --> 01:00:34.280
The phone's going to ring now.
电话现在要响了。

1354
01:00:34.520 --> 01:00:35.140
Not good.
不妙。

1355
01:00:35.280 --> 01:00:36.120
It's David Wallace.
是大卫·华莱士。

1356
01:00:37.160 --> 01:00:39.320
Pam says Michael's having a colonoscopy.
帕姆说迈克尔要去照肠镜。

1357
01:00:40.060 --> 01:00:43.500
I'm not sure that David Wallace believes it.
我不确定大卫·华莱士信不信。

1358
01:00:44.120 --> 01:00:44.720
You think?
你觉得呢？

1359
01:00:45.860 --> 01:00:48.080
Because he was just in Washington.
因为他刚才还在华盛顿。

1360
01:00:49.360 --> 01:00:54.760
Michael gets on the phone with him and literally is reading off the procedure of how you give
迈克尔接了他的电话，竟然照着电脑上的内容，

1361
01:00:54.760 --> 01:00:56.700
a colonoscopy off his computer.
一字一句地念着做肠镜的流程。

1362
01:00:57.260 --> 01:00:58.520
It's pretty amazing.
真是太绝了。

1363
01:00:59.060 --> 01:01:00.680
But now it is clear.
但现在情况明朗了。

1364
01:01:00.960 --> 01:01:04.880
David Wallace says, the company is going to lose a lot of money.
大卫·华莱士说，公司要损失一大笔钱。

1365
01:01:05.260 --> 01:01:07.000
How did you let this happen?
你们是怎么搞成这样的？

1366
01:01:07.220 --> 01:01:08.800
Whose idea was it?
是谁的主意？

1367
01:01:08.800 --> 01:01:11.820
Someone's got to pay for this terrible idea.
总得有人为这个糟糕的主意负责。

1368
01:01:12.900 --> 01:01:15.380
Michael tells David Wallace it was Dwight.
迈克尔告诉大卫·华莱士那是德怀特的主意。

1369
01:01:15.660 --> 01:01:17.240
Just so devious.
真是太阴险了。

1370
01:01:17.460 --> 01:01:18.000
I know.
我知道。

1371
01:01:18.300 --> 01:01:19.460
Oh, Michael.
噢，迈克尔。

1372
01:01:19.820 --> 01:01:22.220
Well, it's like David Wallace is just naming people.
大卫·华莱士就像是在随口点名一样。

1373
01:01:22.460 --> 01:01:24.140
And he says, was it Dwight?
他说，是德怀特吗？

1374
01:01:24.300 --> 01:01:27.340
And Michael's like, yes.
迈克尔就说，是的。

1375
01:01:28.460 --> 01:01:31.900
Well, now Michael has got to convince Dwight to take the fall for him.
现在迈克尔得说服德怀特替他背黑锅。

1376
01:01:32.100 --> 01:01:32.400
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1377
01:01:33.060 --> 01:01:37.720
And so he's going to get out his diary and he's going to say, Dwight, I wrote it down
于是他拿出日记本说，德怀特，我写下来了，

1378
01:01:37.720 --> 01:01:38.500
that it was your idea.
这主意是你出的。

1379
01:01:38.680 --> 01:01:42.820
He tries to convince Dwight that Dwight is remembering wrong.
他试图让德怀特相信是德怀特记错了。

1380
01:01:43.000 --> 01:01:43.240
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1381
01:01:43.380 --> 01:01:45.140
What happened this morning?
今天早上发生了什么？

1382
01:01:45.700 --> 01:01:48.380
Now, you know, Dwight runs to get his diary.
然后，你知道的，德怀特跑去拿他的日记本。

1383
01:01:48.680 --> 01:01:51.320
It's like the dueling diaries where they're going back and forth.
就像两本决斗的日记，他们你来我往地争论。

1384
01:01:51.720 --> 01:01:55.240
Michael realizes he's not making any headway with this whole diary business.
迈克尔意识到他在日记这事上毫无进展。

1385
01:01:55.240 --> 01:01:58.120
So he says, would you like to go out to lunch with me?
于是他说，你想跟我一起去吃午饭吗？

1386
01:01:58.400 --> 01:01:59.200
Just the two of us.
就我们俩。

1387
01:01:59.860 --> 01:02:02.620
And Dwight says, with all my heart.
德怀特说，我全心全意愿意。

1388
01:02:03.120 --> 01:02:05.460
This scene continues in the script, Jenna.
珍娜，剧本里这段戏还在继续。

1389
01:02:05.740 --> 01:02:10.040
So after Dwight says, with all my heart, he says, but I already ate lunch.
德怀特说完“我全心全意愿意”后，又说，但我已经吃过午饭了。

1390
01:02:10.660 --> 01:02:13.220
And Michael says, it's 11 a.m.
迈克尔说，现在才早上11点。

1391
01:02:13.620 --> 01:02:16.500
Dwight says, as a farmer, I eat breakfast at 4.30.
德怀特说，作为农民，我4点半就吃早饭了。

1392
01:02:16.780 --> 01:02:19.140
At 10, I'm famished for lunch.
10点的时候，我就饿得想吃午饭了。

1393
01:02:19.140 --> 01:02:21.760
If you wait three hours, we can have supper, maybe.
如果你等三个小时，也许我们可以吃晚饭。

1394
01:02:22.340 --> 01:02:23.400
Michael says, no, no, no.
迈克尔说，不，不，不。

1395
01:02:23.600 --> 01:02:25.840
How about we do something else you like?
我们做点别的你喜欢的事怎么样？

1396
01:02:26.580 --> 01:02:29.040
Jenna, did you notice there are no scenes of them at the restaurant?
珍娜，你有没有注意到他们去餐厅的戏份全没了？

1397
01:02:29.940 --> 01:02:31.820
They're supposedly going to have lunch, right?
他们本来说要去吃午饭的，对吧？

1398
01:02:31.940 --> 01:02:34.520
Because in the episode, Michael says, go have lunch.
因为在剧集里，迈克尔说，去吃午饭吧。

1399
01:02:34.640 --> 01:02:36.560
We don't know that Dwight's already eaten.
我们并不知道德怀特已经吃过了。

1400
01:02:36.720 --> 01:02:38.320
All of that's been cut out, right?
那些内容都被剪掉了，对吧？

1401
01:02:38.540 --> 01:02:42.240
And then the remainder of their scenes, they're on the side of the road.
然后他们剩下的戏份，都是在路边拍的。

1402
01:02:42.380 --> 01:02:43.300
They're taking a walk.
他们在散步。

1403
01:02:44.120 --> 01:02:48.580
Well, here is a scene that was in the deleted scenes that I just love so much.
嗯，这里有个删减片段，我特别喜欢。

1404
01:02:48.580 --> 01:02:52.260
Of all the things that Dwight would want to do, guess what he loves to do?
在德怀特想做的所有事情里，你猜他最喜欢做什么？

1405
01:02:52.400 --> 01:02:53.500
Go for walks?
去散步？

1406
01:02:54.120 --> 01:02:55.200
Oh, lady, no.
噢，女士，才不是。

1407
01:02:56.060 --> 01:02:57.420
He likes a stroll.
他喜欢溜达。

1408
01:02:58.080 --> 01:03:00.660
Are you still taking those strolls that you like to take?
你还在进行你喜欢的那种溜达吗？

1409
01:03:00.880 --> 01:03:01.520
Thrice weekly.
一周三次。

1410
01:03:02.200 --> 01:03:04.500
Okay, let's go take a stroll together.
好吧，我们一起去溜达溜达。

1411
01:03:04.800 --> 01:03:06.020
I thought you said my strolls were silly.
我以为你说我的溜达很傻。

1412
01:03:06.120 --> 01:03:08.500
No, just because you can't call them walks.
不，只是因为你不能管那叫散步。

1413
01:03:08.760 --> 01:03:09.500
You really want a stroll?
你真的想溜达？

1414
01:03:10.500 --> 01:03:10.940
Yes.
是的。

1415
01:03:11.140 --> 01:03:13.000
You want a power stroll or just a regular stroll?
你是想强力溜达还是普通溜达？

1416
01:03:13.780 --> 01:03:14.660
You call it.
你说了算。

1417
01:03:14.840 --> 01:03:15.480
Power stroll.
强力溜达。

1418
01:03:16.840 --> 01:03:17.280
Okay.
好吧。

1419
01:03:17.660 --> 01:03:18.380
You wearing sunblock?
你涂防晒霜了吗？

1420
01:03:18.580 --> 01:03:19.120
Yes.
涂了。

1421
01:03:19.260 --> 01:03:19.760
What SPF?
SPF多少？

1422
01:03:20.020 --> 01:03:20.420
One.
1。

1423
01:03:21.060 --> 01:03:22.220
That's like water.
那跟水有什么区别。

1424
01:03:22.720 --> 01:03:23.880
I'll grab my tube.
我去拿我的防晒霜。

1425
01:03:24.040 --> 01:03:24.360
Okay.
好的。

1426
01:03:25.100 --> 01:03:25.460
Oh.
噢。

1427
01:03:27.540 --> 01:03:29.100
He loves a stroll.
他就是喜欢溜达。

1428
01:03:29.640 --> 01:03:33.940
Clearly, it's like a whole thing with him and Michael about calling it a stroll or a walk.
很明显，他和迈克尔之间关于管这叫溜达还是散步，成了他们之间的一个梗。

1429
01:03:34.120 --> 01:03:38.620
Then there's another scene where they're down in the lobby and Hank is there.
然后还有另一个场景，他们在大厅里，汉克也在那儿。

1430
01:03:38.820 --> 01:03:41.760
And Dwight is putting sunscreen on Michael's face.
德怀特正在给迈克尔脸上涂防晒霜。

1431
01:03:41.920 --> 01:03:44.360
And Hank looks up and Deadpan says,
汉克抬头面无表情地说，

1432
01:03:44.480 --> 01:03:46.220
You found somebody to go on a stroll.
你找到一起溜达的人了。

1433
01:03:47.560 --> 01:03:48.640
And Dwight goes,
德怀特回答说，

1434
01:03:48.760 --> 01:03:49.200
I did.
是的。

1435
01:03:49.360 --> 01:03:49.980
And Hank goes,
汉克说，

1436
01:03:50.560 --> 01:03:50.820
Nice.
不错。

1437
01:03:51.680 --> 01:03:57.460
This is amazing because we got a ton of mail because people were pointing out Dwight's shoes.
这太棒了，因为我们收到了海量的邮件，大家都在指出德怀特的鞋子。

1438
01:03:57.460 --> 01:04:04.100
In the scene when he is walking, aka strolling with Michael, tons of people said,
在那个他走路，也就是和迈克尔溜达的场景里，很多人问，

1439
01:04:04.400 --> 01:04:09.760
Why does Dwight have on very white, very non-Dwight trainers?
为什么德怀特穿着那种非常白、非常不像德怀特风格的运动鞋？

1440
01:04:09.760 --> 01:04:12.400
Like, where did these come from?
就是说，这些鞋是从哪儿来的？

1441
01:04:13.020 --> 01:04:16.140
And I looked in the script and it says,
我查了剧本，上面写着，

1442
01:04:16.780 --> 01:04:18.100
Michael and Dwight are walking.
迈克尔和德怀特在走路。

1443
01:04:18.260 --> 01:04:24.140
Dwight is wearing sneakers and walks with his hands clasped behind his back.
德怀特穿着运动鞋，双手背在身后走着。

1444
01:04:24.720 --> 01:04:26.200
That was like a script note.
那就像是个剧本备注。

1445
01:04:26.340 --> 01:04:30.440
But I'm sure it was all based on this backstory that Dwight strolls three times a week.
但我敢肯定，这都是基于德怀特每周溜达三次的背景设定。

1446
01:04:30.560 --> 01:04:31.320
He's got his sunblock.
他有他的防晒霜。

1447
01:04:31.440 --> 01:04:32.300
He's got his shoes.
他有他的鞋子。

1448
01:04:32.500 --> 01:04:34.520
He probably has a little bag he takes to work.
他可能还有个带去上班的小包。

1449
01:04:34.940 --> 01:04:39.440
Clearly, Hank knows how much Dwight loves a stroll and how he's been looking for a stroll buddy.
很明显，汉克知道德怀特有多喜欢溜达，也知道他一直在找个溜达搭子。

1450
01:04:39.680 --> 01:04:40.640
I love it.
我太喜欢这个了。

1451
01:04:41.840 --> 01:04:42.800
I love it.
我喜欢这个。

1452
01:04:42.800 --> 01:04:43.040
I know.
我知道。

1453
01:04:43.140 --> 01:04:43.720
It tickled me.
这让我觉得很有趣。

1454
01:04:44.240 --> 01:04:46.800
Well, this stroll is not going to convince Dwight.
好吧，这次散步可说服不了德怀特。

1455
01:04:47.160 --> 01:04:49.620
Dwight says, I am not going to fall on my sword for you.
德怀特说，我可不会为了你而引咎辞职。

1456
01:04:49.700 --> 01:04:50.640
It's not going to happen.
这不可能发生。

1457
01:04:51.040 --> 01:04:52.100
He's done it before.
他以前干过这事。

1458
01:04:52.340 --> 01:04:54.220
He's fallen on his sword and it wasn't pleasant.
他曾经引咎辞职过，那滋味可不好受。

1459
01:04:54.260 --> 01:04:55.060
It wasn't.
确实不好受。

1460
01:04:55.360 --> 01:04:57.260
Michael makes a pretty big speech to Dwight.
迈克尔对德怀特发表了一番慷慨激昂的演说。

1461
01:04:57.360 --> 01:04:59.460
He's like, listen, why would you want to stay here?
他就像是说，听着，你为什么非要留在这儿呢？

1462
01:04:59.600 --> 01:04:59.860
Yeah.
是啊。

1463
01:05:00.120 --> 01:05:00.940
You're cooped up.
你被困在这里了。

1464
01:05:01.020 --> 01:05:03.000
You're not even dating Angela anymore.
你甚至都不和安吉拉约会了。

1465
01:05:03.200 --> 01:05:04.260
You have a whole farm.
你还有一整个农场呢。

1466
01:05:04.560 --> 01:05:04.920
Yeah.
没错。

1467
01:05:05.600 --> 01:05:09.680
And he says, you know, on the other hand, I would be lost without Dunder Mifflin.
然后他说，你知道，另一方面，没有邓德·米夫林我可活不下去。

1468
01:05:09.680 --> 01:05:12.840
And Dwight says, what about Shulala, Michael?
德怀特就问，那“舒啦啦”呢，迈克尔？

1469
01:05:15.090 --> 01:05:17.810
This is a Mindy Kaling thing, for sure.
这绝对是敏迪·卡灵的手笔。

1470
01:05:18.070 --> 01:05:20.290
This has Mindy Kaling written all over it.
这上面写满了敏迪·卡灵的名字。

1471
01:05:20.430 --> 01:05:25.930
And then Michael has a talking head where he says, I have an idea for a fancy men's shoe store called Shulala.
然后迈克尔有个单人访谈，他说，我有个点子，想开一家叫“舒啦啦”的高档男鞋店。

1472
01:05:25.990 --> 01:05:35.610
And it's just men's shoes for the special occasions in a man's life, like the day that you get married or the day your wife has a baby or just for lounging around the house.
店里只卖男鞋，专供男人生命中的特殊场合，比如结婚那天，或者妻子生孩子那天，又或者只是在家里闲逛时穿的。

1473
01:05:35.790 --> 01:05:36.090
Yeah.
是啊。

1474
01:05:36.090 --> 01:05:46.430
Well, we got some mail from Kayla G, who said, I just want to let you ladies know that Michael seems to have gotten Shulala up and running in Nelson, British Columbia.
我们收到了凯拉·G的来信，她说，我想让你们这些女士知道，迈克尔似乎已经在不列颠哥伦比亚省的纳尔逊把“舒啦啦”开起来了。

1475
01:05:46.910 --> 01:05:47.310
Oh.
噢。

1476
01:05:47.550 --> 01:05:50.750
And I looked it up, and sure enough, there is a Shulala.
我查了一下，果然有一家叫“舒啦啦”的店。

1477
01:05:51.330 --> 01:05:59.210
According to their website, they are a boutique shoe store offering exquisite leather footwear and handbags from all over the world.
根据他们的网站显示，这是一家精品鞋店，提供来自世界各地的精致皮鞋和手袋。

1478
01:05:59.450 --> 01:06:03.830
They are a family-run business that has been around since 1983.
他们是一家自1983年就开始经营的家族企业。

1479
01:06:04.790 --> 01:06:05.090
Hmm.
嗯。

1480
01:06:05.090 --> 01:06:10.270
Well, I want you guys to know that there is a Shulala in Lafayette, Louisiana.
好吧，我想让你们知道，在路易斯安那州的拉斐特也有一家“舒啦啦”。

1481
01:06:11.330 --> 01:06:12.850
I saw that, too.
我也看到了。

1482
01:06:12.870 --> 01:06:14.590
My town where I was born.
那是我出生的城市。

1483
01:06:15.150 --> 01:06:15.670
Lafayette.
拉斐特。

1484
01:06:15.770 --> 01:06:16.330
And you know what?
而且你知道吗？

1485
01:06:16.330 --> 01:06:18.810
I love the slogan for their shoe store.
我超爱他们鞋店的标语。

1486
01:06:18.810 --> 01:06:21.730
If you go on their website, it's a clothing boutique and shoes.
如果你去他们的网站看，那是一家服装和鞋类精品店。

1487
01:06:21.930 --> 01:06:26.170
But their slogan is, life is short, buy the damn shoes.
但他们的标语是：人生苦短，买下那双该死的鞋。

1488
01:06:27.990 --> 01:06:29.270
That is amazing.
太棒了。

1489
01:06:29.610 --> 01:06:34.250
So there are two Shulalas, Michael, but none of them seem to sell men's shoes.
所以迈克尔，现在有两家“舒啦啦”，但似乎都不卖男鞋。

1490
01:06:34.250 --> 01:06:35.090
Oh.
噢。

1491
01:06:36.130 --> 01:06:39.170
Well, I would love nothing more for Michael to have Shulala.
好吧，我最希望看到的就是迈克尔真的拥有“舒啦啦”。

1492
01:06:39.170 --> 01:06:43.810
Well, we have a great reverse talking head.
我们有一个很棒的反向单人访谈。

1493
01:06:43.810 --> 01:06:45.150
Yes, I noticed.
是的，我注意到了。

1494
01:06:45.610 --> 01:06:50.610
So Dwight is in Michael's chair, and you pull back to reveal Michael perched behind him.
德怀特坐在迈克尔的椅子上，镜头拉开，露出迈克尔正蹲在他身后。

1495
01:06:51.030 --> 01:06:54.330
Basically, in this talking head, Michael's like, he's going to do it for me.
基本上，在这个访谈里，迈克尔的意思是，他会为我做这件事的。

1496
01:06:54.430 --> 01:06:55.030
He's going to do it.
他会做的。

1497
01:06:55.090 --> 01:06:56.110
He's going to take the fall.
他会替我背黑锅的。

1498
01:06:56.370 --> 01:06:57.930
And Dwight's like, no, I haven't decided.
而德怀特却说，不，我还没决定呢。

1499
01:06:58.530 --> 01:07:00.890
Well, folks in the office are starting to catch on.
好吧，办公室里的人开始察觉到了。

1500
01:07:01.070 --> 01:07:01.830
They get it.
他们都明白了。

1501
01:07:01.950 --> 01:07:03.010
They know what Michael's doing.
他们知道迈克尔在做什么。

1502
01:07:03.010 --> 01:07:08.210
He wants Dwight to take the fall, and they start gossiping about it.
他想让德怀特背黑锅，于是他们开始议论纷纷。

1503
01:07:08.550 --> 01:07:13.770
There's a scene in the kitchen, you guys, that was deleted, where Meredith, Kelly, and
大家伙儿，厨房里有一段被删减的戏，梅瑞狄斯、凯莉和

1504
01:07:13.770 --> 01:07:16.510
Angela, and Oscar are all being real chatty.
安吉拉，还有奥斯卡都在那儿聊得火热。

1505
01:07:16.510 --> 01:07:19.290
And Michael walks in and overhears a bit.
然后迈克尔走进来，无意中听到了一些。

1506
01:07:19.670 --> 01:07:21.930
And he's spying on them from the bathroom.
他还在洗手间里偷听他们说话。

1507
01:07:22.190 --> 01:07:22.810
Let's hear it.
让我们听听看。

1508
01:07:23.330 --> 01:07:23.650
Ladies.
女士们。

1509
01:07:25.050 --> 01:07:25.410
Really?
真的吗？

1510
01:07:26.570 --> 01:07:29.330
I hope Dwight gets fired and we get a hot new guy to replace him.
我希望德怀特被开除，然后我们能换个帅气的新人来顶替他。

1511
01:07:29.490 --> 01:07:29.850
Seriously?
认真的吗？

1512
01:07:30.210 --> 01:07:31.110
What if it's a hot new girl?
要是换个火辣的新女孩呢？

1513
01:07:31.550 --> 01:07:32.810
Oh my God, I had not thought of that.
天哪，我还没想过这一点。

1514
01:07:33.290 --> 01:07:35.250
I think it's horrible what Michael is doing.
我觉得迈克尔做的事太恶劣了。

1515
01:07:35.950 --> 01:07:36.350
Really.
确实。

1516
01:07:36.630 --> 01:07:37.910
I mean, this is unacceptable.
我是说，这简直无法接受。

1517
01:07:44.010 --> 01:07:47.590
Hey, did you ever notice that our bathroom is right next to our kitchen?
嘿，你们有没有注意到我们的洗手间就在厨房隔壁？

1518
01:07:48.730 --> 01:07:49.830
How's that up to code?
这怎么符合建筑规范的？

1519
01:07:51.880 --> 01:07:52.660
I don't know.
我不知道。

1520
01:07:56.090 --> 01:07:58.250
This is not fair what he's doing to Dwight.
他对德怀特做的事太不公平了。

1521
01:07:58.330 --> 01:07:59.150
Of course you think that.
你当然会这么想。

1522
01:07:59.230 --> 01:07:59.910
He's the bone guy.
他是那个“搞”你的人。

1523
01:08:00.350 --> 01:08:01.570
I think men bone women.
我觉得是男人“搞”女人。

1524
01:08:01.790 --> 01:08:02.810
I hate that I'm correcting that.
我真讨厌我居然还要纠正这个。

1525
01:08:03.010 --> 01:08:05.850
All I'm saying is that Dwight can't take the blame for this.
我只是说德怀特不该为此背锅。

1526
01:08:06.010 --> 01:08:07.250
It has to land on Michael.
这事儿必须得算在迈克尔头上。

1527
01:08:07.670 --> 01:08:08.890
It's time for a reckoning.
是时候清算一下了。

1528
01:08:08.990 --> 01:08:09.270
It's true.
确实如此。

1529
01:08:10.270 --> 01:08:10.830
Okay.
好吧。

1530
01:08:11.610 --> 01:08:14.110
These are the kind of slice of life.
这就是那种生活片段。

1531
01:08:14.650 --> 01:08:15.690
Slice of life.
生活片段。

1532
01:08:15.910 --> 01:08:16.610
Slice of life.
生活片段。

1533
01:08:16.750 --> 01:08:17.410
You brought it back.
你又把它提出来了。

1534
01:08:17.790 --> 01:08:22.750
These are the kind of slice of life office moments that I love so much.
我非常喜欢这种办公室里的生活片段。

1535
01:08:22.750 --> 01:08:24.010
Just the scuttlebutt.
就是这些闲言碎语。

1536
01:08:24.130 --> 01:08:25.630
There's so much going on.
发生了好多事。

1537
01:08:25.830 --> 01:08:27.990
Just the gossip and the opinions.
全是八卦和观点。

1538
01:08:28.210 --> 01:08:28.470
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1539
01:08:28.870 --> 01:08:29.290
You know?
你知道吧？

1540
01:08:29.470 --> 01:08:30.850
I loved this scene.
我很喜欢这一幕。

1541
01:08:31.130 --> 01:08:33.210
And Michael overhears it, you guys.
而且迈克尔听到了，伙计们。

1542
01:08:33.350 --> 01:08:37.070
And there's a whole scene where Michael confronts everyone.
还有一整段戏是迈克尔去质问所有人。

1543
01:08:37.690 --> 01:08:40.110
And he really lets him have it.
他真的把他们训了一顿。

1544
01:08:40.270 --> 01:08:42.270
He goes barging into the bullpen.
他冲进办公区。

1545
01:08:42.270 --> 01:08:43.790
And he's like, hey, everyone.
他说，嘿，大家。

1546
01:08:43.790 --> 01:08:45.410
I need to make an announcement.
我要宣布一件事。

1547
01:08:45.690 --> 01:08:47.390
And Jim is like, this is a new record.
吉姆说，这又破纪录了。

1548
01:08:47.730 --> 01:08:52.070
And Michael goes, that's because I have a lot to say today, James.
迈克尔回道，那是因为我今天有很多话要说，詹姆斯。

1549
01:08:52.930 --> 01:08:53.550
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1550
01:08:53.690 --> 01:08:54.690
He's ticked off.
他气坏了。

1551
01:08:54.810 --> 01:08:59.150
And then he goes around the room and he's like, yells to the room, have you wondered
然后他在房间里走来走去，大声问大家，你们有没有想过

1552
01:08:59.150 --> 01:09:00.850
what it would be like if I was fired?
如果我被解雇了会怎么样？

1553
01:09:00.850 --> 01:09:03.490
And everyone, super happy, raises their hand.
结果每个人都超级高兴地举起了手。

1554
01:09:03.830 --> 01:09:05.930
And Michael's like, damn it.
迈克尔就说，该死。

1555
01:09:05.930 --> 01:09:08.210
I didn't ask for a show of hands.
我没让你们举手。

1556
01:09:08.720 --> 01:09:13.330
If I get fired and corporate brings in new leadership, you have no idea who might come.
如果我被解雇，公司派来新领导，你们根本不知道会来什么人。

1557
01:09:13.490 --> 01:09:15.990
And then he starts singling people out.
然后他开始点名批评大家。

1558
01:09:16.230 --> 01:09:19.770
He says, you have no idea how bad it could get.
他说，你们根本不知道情况会变得多糟糕。

1559
01:09:19.970 --> 01:09:24.390
Maybe it would be someone who knows that we don't actually need three accountants.
也许来的人会发现，我们根本不需要三个会计。

1560
01:09:24.710 --> 01:09:26.710
I remember shooting this scene now.
我现在想起拍这场戏了。

1561
01:09:26.810 --> 01:09:27.250
Yes.
是的。

1562
01:09:27.410 --> 01:09:28.950
It's in the deleted scenes.
这是删减片段里的。

1563
01:09:28.950 --> 01:09:34.010
Then he looks right at Jim and Pam and he says, or let's couples work together without
然后他直视吉姆和帕姆说，或者让情侣一起工作，而不用

1564
01:09:34.010 --> 01:09:35.970
sending them to different branches.
把他们调到不同的分部。

1565
01:09:36.850 --> 01:09:39.550
And then he has this moment and made me laugh.
接着他有个瞬间把我逗笑了。

1566
