1724
01:15:50.300 --> 01:15:50.660
And going in the sun.
然后去晒太阳。

1725
01:15:50.740 --> 01:15:50.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1726
01:15:50.900 --> 01:15:51.660
Right.
没错。

1727
01:15:52.300 --> 01:15:53.000
I don't know.
我不知道。

1728
01:15:53.260 --> 01:15:54.120
I'm just saying.
我只是随口一说。

1729
01:15:54.300 --> 01:15:54.560
Okay.
好吧。

1730
01:15:54.940 --> 01:15:56.120
Well, very passionate.
嗯，真是充满激情。

1731
01:15:56.280 --> 01:15:56.400
The toilet buddy.
厕所好伙伴。

1732
01:15:56.620 --> 01:15:57.600
The tan baster.
美黑刷。

1733
01:15:59.680 --> 01:16:00.920
Stacy, I'm sorry.
斯泰西，抱歉。

1734
01:16:00.920 --> 01:16:02.340
We never got it off the ground.
我们一直没能把它做出来。

1735
01:16:04.900 --> 01:16:05.580
Oh, well.
噢，好吧。

1736
01:16:05.940 --> 01:16:10.320
Stacy, somewhere you guys have a sketch of the tan baster, and I'd love to see it.
斯泰西，你们肯定在哪儿存着美黑刷的设计草图，我真想看看。

1737
01:16:10.460 --> 01:16:12.240
We do have a sketch of the tan baster.
我们确实有美黑刷的草图。

1738
01:16:12.500 --> 01:16:17.260
You know I've been trying to work that tan baster into a lot of projects for you and I.
你知道我一直想把美黑刷加进我们俩的很多项目中。

1739
01:16:17.720 --> 01:16:20.240
Lady, we're not going to have an office ladies tan baster.
大姐，我们不会出“办公室女士”美黑刷的。

1740
01:16:20.900 --> 01:16:22.100
It's just not happening.
这事儿没戏。

1741
01:16:23.460 --> 01:16:23.860
Okay.
好吧。

1742
01:16:24.060 --> 01:16:24.920
You know what I want?
你知道我想要什么吗？

1743
01:16:25.020 --> 01:16:27.420
Before we do a tan baster, I want a rosé.
在做美黑刷之前，我想要一款桃红葡萄酒。

1744
01:16:27.600 --> 01:16:27.920
Okay?
好吗？

1745
01:16:28.640 --> 01:16:30.900
I think more of us would use the rosé.
我觉得我们会有更多人想用桃红葡萄酒。

1746
01:16:31.620 --> 01:16:32.900
Let's put a poll out there.
我们发起个投票吧。

1747
01:16:32.940 --> 01:16:33.200
No!
不行！

1748
01:16:33.320 --> 01:16:34.420
What do you want more?
你们更想要什么？

1749
01:16:34.520 --> 01:16:38.340
An office ladies rosé or an office ladies tan baster?
“办公室女士”桃红葡萄酒，还是“办公室女士”美黑刷？

1750
01:16:38.840 --> 01:16:39.940
I got to go with tan baster.
我选美黑刷。

1751
01:16:39.980 --> 01:16:42.000
I knew you were going to say it, Sam.
我就知道你会这么说，萨姆。

1752
01:16:42.120 --> 01:16:42.700
I knew it.
我早料到了。

1753
01:16:42.880 --> 01:16:43.940
Why did you think I was going to say it?
你为什么觉得我会这么说？

1754
01:16:44.100 --> 01:16:44.500
Novelty.
图个新鲜。

1755
01:16:44.720 --> 01:16:49.320
No, because a lot of the sprays and sticks have harmful chemicals in them, like aerosols and
不，因为很多喷雾和棒状产品里都有害人的化学物质，比如气溶胶和

1756
01:16:49.320 --> 01:16:50.400
things that are bad for you.
对身体不好的东西。

1757
01:16:50.980 --> 01:16:51.460
Cassie?
凯西？

1758
01:16:51.820 --> 01:16:53.200
I'm team rosé.
我站桃红葡萄酒队。

1759
01:16:53.360 --> 01:16:53.620
Yay!
耶！

1760
01:16:55.760 --> 01:16:56.960
Always going to try wine.
总得试试酒嘛。

1761
01:16:57.140 --> 01:16:58.440
Well, you know what?
好吧，你知道吗？

1762
01:16:58.480 --> 01:17:00.320
Let's drink rosé while we baste ourselves.
我们边往身上涂抹边喝桃红吧。

1763
01:17:00.540 --> 01:17:02.340
Is it possible to baste rosé into my mouth?
能不能把桃红直接往我嘴里灌？

1764
01:17:02.680 --> 01:17:03.120
Hey!
嘿！

1765
01:17:04.000 --> 01:17:04.700
Rosé baster!
桃红灌酒器！

1766
01:17:04.700 --> 01:17:05.700
A rosé baster!
一个桃红灌酒器！

1767
01:17:06.640 --> 01:17:07.120
Perhaps.
也许吧。

1768
01:17:08.340 --> 01:17:09.500
Oh my word.
天哪。

1769
01:17:09.660 --> 01:17:10.560
Where are we?
我们到哪儿了？

1770
01:17:10.680 --> 01:17:13.180
Oh, you guys, we got to check back in with Kevin and Lynn.
噢，伙计们，我们得回去看看凯文和琳恩的情况了。

1771
01:17:13.180 --> 01:17:21.600
We do, because poor Kevin has been receiving a lot of advice this whole episode, and guess
确实，因为可怜的凯文这一整集都在被各种指点，结果你猜怎么着？

1772
01:17:21.600 --> 01:17:21.920
what?
猜猜看？

1773
01:17:22.120 --> 01:17:29.760
When he finally does meet up with Lynn in the parking lot, he does just fine being Kevin.
当他最终在停车场见到琳恩时，他只要做回凯文自己就表现得很好。

1774
01:17:29.760 --> 01:17:32.700
He says, I'm just going to say everything I'm thinking.
他说，我打算想到什么就说什么。

1775
01:17:33.420 --> 01:17:35.380
She has a great smile.
她的笑容很灿烂。

1776
01:17:35.660 --> 01:17:37.760
He'd like to take her for dinner and a movie.
他想约她吃顿饭看场电影。

1777
01:17:38.480 --> 01:17:39.800
She says yes.
她答应了。

1778
01:17:39.800 --> 01:17:40.820
He's happy.
他很开心。

1779
01:17:41.020 --> 01:17:42.900
And then he says, boobs.
然后他说，胸部。

1780
01:17:43.600 --> 01:17:45.180
And she's delighted.
她却很高兴。

1781
01:17:45.640 --> 01:17:45.820
Yeah.
是啊。

1782
01:17:46.880 --> 01:17:48.780
Lynn just likes Kevin.
琳恩就是喜欢凯文。

1783
01:17:49.220 --> 01:17:49.540
Yeah.
没错。

1784
01:17:50.260 --> 01:17:52.880
Like you said, there's a lid for every pot.
就像你说的，锅配锅，盖配盖。

1785
01:17:53.100 --> 01:17:53.780
There is.
确实如此。

1786
01:17:54.600 --> 01:17:58.160
Dwight's advice to Kevin was just go be alive next to her.
德怀特给凯文的建议就是，只要在她身边活出自我。

1787
01:17:59.620 --> 01:18:00.640
Will it work?
这招管用吗？

1788
01:18:01.640 --> 01:18:04.120
And finally, we have our tag.
最后，我们来看片尾彩蛋。

1789
01:18:04.360 --> 01:18:06.560
A final knock-knock joke.
一个最后的敲门笑话。

1790
01:18:06.700 --> 01:18:07.940
A ding-dong joke, really.
其实是个按门铃笑话。

1791
01:18:08.680 --> 01:18:10.360
Yeah, we talked about this with Rain.
是啊，我们和雷恩聊过这个。

1792
01:18:10.480 --> 01:18:15.180
This one is so hilarious, because Dwight thinks he's going to get Jim back, and he does
这个特别搞笑，因为德怀特以为他能整蛊吉姆，他按了门铃，结果吉姆说，你知道吗？

1793
01:18:15.180 --> 01:18:17.040
ding-dong, and then Jim's like, you know what?
我刚洗完澡。

1794
01:18:17.040 --> 01:18:18.060
I just got out of the shower.
让我准备一秒钟。

1795
01:18:18.180 --> 01:18:18.960
I need one second.
然后就像我们聊到的，他们来回推拉，比如，好吧，那我待会儿再来。

1796
01:18:19.480 --> 01:18:23.600
And then like we talked about, they go back and forth with like, well, I can come back.
你什么时候方便？

1797
01:18:23.700 --> 01:18:24.460
When's good for you?
这简直太荒谬了。

1798
01:18:24.580 --> 01:18:26.080
It's like so ridiculous.
这就是《金奖券》这一集。

1799
01:18:27.000 --> 01:18:28.680
And that is Golden Ticket.
希望你们喜欢。

1800
01:18:28.920 --> 01:18:29.960
We hope you enjoyed.
希望你们看得开心。

1801
01:18:30.020 --> 01:18:31.580
I loved this episode.
我很喜欢这一集。

1802
01:18:31.800 --> 01:18:32.660
I did too.
我也是。

1803
01:18:33.000 --> 01:18:35.520
And thank you, Rainn Wilson, for coming on our podcaSt.
还有谢谢你，雷恩·威尔森，来参加我们的播客。

1804
01:18:35.520 --> 01:18:39.240
That just gave me all the warm fuzzies for the whole day.
这让我一整天心里都暖暖的。

1805
01:18:39.480 --> 01:18:41.280
I really do want us to go over there.
我是真的很想让我们去你那边。

1806
01:18:41.420 --> 01:18:43.140
You know, we have an office text thread.
你知道的，我们有个办公室群聊。

1807
01:18:43.140 --> 01:18:47.320
We've talked about this, where the cast text each other, and we have all invited ourselves
我们聊过这个，就是演员们会互发短信，我们都自作主张地邀请了自己

1808
01:18:47.320 --> 01:18:48.280
over to Rainn's.
去雷恩家。

1809
01:18:48.520 --> 01:18:51.780
So Rainn, and sorry, Holly, we're coming.
所以雷恩，抱歉了霍莉，我们要去了。

1810
01:18:52.060 --> 01:18:52.700
We are.
我们真的会去。

1811
01:18:52.920 --> 01:18:55.480
You know, you told us sometime after Labor Day.
你知道，你告诉过我们劳动节之后某个时间。

1812
01:18:55.740 --> 01:18:57.200
Well, it's after Labor Day.
嗯，现在已经是劳动节之后了。

1813
01:18:57.260 --> 01:18:58.800
Guess who remembered the date you told her?
猜猜是谁记住了你告诉她的日期？

1814
01:18:59.720 --> 01:19:00.440
That's right.
没错。

1815
01:19:00.560 --> 01:19:01.300
Of course.
当然是我。

1816
01:19:01.300 --> 01:19:02.360
I want to go.
我想去。

1817
01:19:02.980 --> 01:19:04.840
Well, guys, we will see you next week.
好了，各位，我们下周见。

